From: Stained Glass OS <ke7oxh@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] setupapi: disk space from inf sections, source sizes, source list, directory ids (2054)

setupapi: disk space lists from inf sections, source file sizes, source list removal, directory ids.

SetupAddSectionToDiskSpaceList and SetupAddInstallSectionToDiskSpaceList (the
A one only returned success) fill the list from the files of a copy or delete
section, or from the CopyFiles and DelFiles of an install section (sizes from
the SourceDisksFiles lines, files named @file included), and the Remove
forms take them out again. SetupAdjustDiskSpaceList changes the space a
drive needs by an amount, SetupGetSourceFileSize gives the size of a source
file or of a section's files rounded up, SetupRemoveFromSourceList takes a
place out of the list to install from, and SetupSetDirectoryIdEx sets a
directory id with flags. They were stubs.
---
